source binding/reference Adjacency in is_connected@269; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def is_connected(adjacency: Adjacency, members: list[str]) -> bool:
    """Return whether the induced community subgraph is connected."""
    if not members:
        return True
    member_set = set(members)
    stack = [members[0]]
    seen = {members[0]}
    while stack:
        node = stack.pop()
        for neighbor in adjacency.get(node, {}):
            if neighbor in member_set and neighbor not in seen:
                seen.add(neighbor)
                stack.append(neighbor)
    return len(seen) == len(member_set)

