source binding/reference str in symbol_id@32; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def symbol_id(label: str, file_path: str, name: str, owner: str, *disambiguators: str) -> str:
    """Generate a stable symbol ID from repository-relative identity fields."""
    key = f"{label}:{file_path}:"
    if owner:
        key += owner + "."
    key += name
    for disambiguator in disambiguators:
        if disambiguator:
            key += ":" + disambiguator
    return hashlib.sha256(key.encode()).hexdigest()[:24]

