source binding/reference GraphNode in same_file_owner@108; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def same_file_owner(symbol: Symbol, nodes_by_name: dict[str, list[GraphNode]]) -> GraphNode | None:
    """Deterministic same-file owner lookup; owners declared in other files are not linked."""
    for candidate in nodes_by_name.get(symbol.owner_name, []):
        if candidate.properties.to_dict().get("filePath") == symbol.file_path:
            return candidate
    return None

