source binding/reference CorrelationEdge in _require_correlations@344; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _require_correlations(value: object) -> tuple[CorrelationEdge, ...]:
    if not isinstance(value, tuple):
        raise ModelValidationError("provider must return a tuple of correlations")
    values = cast(tuple[object, ...], value)
    if any(not isinstance(edge, CorrelationEdge) for edge in values):
