source binding/reference ExtractionResult in _build_receiver_type_map@211; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _build_receiver_type_map(extraction: ExtractionResult) -> dict[str, dict[str, str]]:
    result: dict[str, dict[str, str]] = {}
    for path, file_result in extraction.files:
        for binding in file_result.type_bindings:
            if not binding.variable_name or not binding.type_name:
                continue
            if binding.variable_name.startswith("@"):
                continue
            result.setdefault(path, {}).setdefault(binding.variable_name, binding.type_name)
    return result

