source binding/reference ResolutionContext in _methods_by_owner@73; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _methods_by_owner(context: ResolutionContext) -> dict[str, dict[str, list[Symbol]]]:
    """Group methods by owner name and file to avoid cross-file ambiguity."""
    by_owner: dict[str, dict[str, list[Symbol]]] = {}
    for symbol in context.symbols:
        if symbol.label != "Method" or not symbol.owner_name:
            continue
        owner_key = f"{symbol.file_path}\x00{symbol.owner_name}"
        by_owner.setdefault(owner_key, {}).setdefault(symbol.name, []).append(symbol)
    return by_owner

