source binding/reference dict in _merge_persona_reports@114; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _merge_persona_reports(submitted: list[dict], scraped: list[dict]) -> list[dict]:
    """Submitted reports plus scraped ones for personas that did not submit."""
    def key(report: dict) -> tuple:
        return (report.get("persona"), report.get("tracking_id"))

    have = {key(r) for r in submitted}
    return [*submitted, *(r for r in scraped if key(r) not in have)]

