source binding/reference GraphInvokeConfig in _make_config@25; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _make_config(options: OneShotOptions | StreamingOptions, buffer: int) -> GraphInvokeConfig:
    """Build a LangGraph invoke config with an optional recursion limit buffer."""
    config: GraphInvokeConfig = {"configurable": {"thread_id": os.urandom(8).hex()}}
    if options.max_turns is not None:
        config["recursion_limit"] = options.max_turns + buffer
    return config

