source binding/reference StreamingOptions in _extra_excluded_tools@78; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _extra_excluded_tools(options: StreamingOptions) -> frozenset[str] | None:
    """Advertisement counterpart of the executor gate: un-offer what it refuses."""
    # From the SAME permitted_tool_calls as PermitTools so the two cannot drift; advertising only
    if options.permitted_tool_calls is None:
        return None
    excluded = ALL_NATIVE_TOOLS - options.permitted_tool_calls
    if options.agents:
        return excluded
    return excluded | frozenset({SUBAGENT_DISPATCH_TOOL})

