source binding/reference Any in to_responses_tool_choice@106; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def to_responses_tool_choice(tool_choice: Any) -> Any:
    """Convert a forced Chat `tool_choice` to its Responses shape; strings pass through."""
    if _is_forced_function_choice(tool_choice):
        return {"type": "function", "name": tool_choice["function"]["name"]}
    return tool_choice

