source binding/reference str in _restore_env_value@113; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _restore_env_value(key: str, value: str | None) -> None:
    """Restore *key* to *value*, or delete it entirely when *value* is None."""
    if value is None:
        os.environ.pop(key, None)
    else:
        os.environ[key] = value

