source binding/reference bool in _grep_wanted@207; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _grep_wanted(rel: str, glob: str | None) -> bool:
    """True when *rel*, or its basename, matches *glob* — or no glob was given."""
    if not glob:
        return True
    pat = glob.lstrip("/").lstrip("\\")
    return fnmatch.fnmatch(rel, pat) or fnmatch.fnmatch(rel.rsplit("/", 1)[-1], pat)

