source binding/reference int in gather_api_artefacts@29; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def gather_api_artefacts(full_files: list[str], max_api_artefacts: int) -> list[str]:
    """Files matching an API-contract glob, in file-list order, capped at `max_api_artefacts`."""
    artefacts: list[str] = []
    for rel in full_files:
        for g in _API_SURFACE_GLOBS:
            if fnmatch.fnmatchcase(rel, g) or fnmatch.fnmatchcase(rel.lower(), g):
                artefacts.append(rel)
                break
    return artefacts[:max_api_artefacts]

