source binding/reference Path in _contained@23; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _contained(root: Path, p: Path) -> Path | None:
    """Resolve `p`; return it if inside `root`, else None (also covers a dangling symlink)."""
    try:
        rp = p.resolve(strict=True)
    except OSError:
        return None
    try:
        rroot = root.resolve(strict=True)
    except OSError:
        return None
    return rp if rp.is_relative_to(rroot) else None

