source binding/reference str in _dig@68; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _dig(data, path: str):
    """Follow a dotted path (``data.token``) into a nested dict; ``None`` if absent."""
    cur = data
    for part in str(path).split("."):
        if isinstance(cur, dict) and part in cur:
            cur = cur[part]
        else:
            return None
    return cur

