source binding/reference str in _manifest_ts_from_started@53; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _manifest_ts_from_started(started_iso: str) -> str:
    """Return the UTC timestamp token used in default run-manifest names."""
    try:
        dt = _dt.datetime.fromisoformat(started_iso.replace("Z", "+00:00"))
    except Exception:
        dt = _dt.datetime.now(_dt.UTC)
    return dt.astimezone(_dt.UTC).strftime("%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ")

