source binding/reference bool in flag@52; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def flag(v: object) -> bool:
    """Coerce a model-emitted flag to a bool, falling back to False rather than raising."""
    if isinstance(v, bool):
        return v
    if isinstance(v, str):
        return v.strip().lower() in {"true", "yes", "1"}
    if isinstance(v, (int, float)):
        return bool(v)
    return False

