callable _app_module_name in module; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _app_module_name(app_id: str, repos: list[dict]) -> str:
    profile, _ = _load_app_profile(app_id)
    if profile and profile.name:
        safe = "".join(c if c.isalnum() or c in "._-" else "_" for c in profile.name)
        return safe or f"app_{app_id}"
