source binding/reference Path in _rmtree_rw@31; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _rmtree_rw(path: Path) -> None:
    """shutil.rmtree that clears the read-only bit on Windows, where RO .git/objects/* make ignore_errors=True silently leave the tree behind."""
    def _on_err(func, p, exc_info):
        try:
            os.chmod(p, stat.S_IWRITE)
            func(p)
        except Exception:
            pass
    shutil.rmtree(path, onerror=_on_err)

