source binding/reference int in parse_hop@41; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def parse_hop(hop: str) -> tuple[str, int | None]:
    """Parse a seed/codeflow hop formatted as "file:line"."""
    file_part, sep, line_part = hop.rpartition(":")
    if sep and file_part and line_part.isdigit():
        return file_part, max(1, int(line_part))
    return hop, None

