source binding/reference str in _erases_language@291; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _erases_language(entry: str) -> str | None:
    """Return the EXT_TO_LANG extension *entry* would erase from scope, else None."""
    m = _BARE_LANG_GLOB.match(entry)
    if m:
        ext = m.group(1).lower()
    elif re.fullmatch(r"\.[A-Za-z0-9_]+", entry):
        ext = entry.lower()
    else:
        return None
    return ext if ext in EXT_TO_LANG else None

