source binding/reference str in _stem@61; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _stem(word: str) -> str:
    """Strips a trailing "ed", "es" or "s" from a word of 6+ letters; shorter words pass through."""
    if len(word) < 6:
        return word
    for suffix in ("ed", "es", "s"):
        if word.endswith(suffix):
            return word[:-len(suffix)]
    return word

source binding/reference suffix in _stem@61; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: for suffix in ("ed", "es", "s"):
