source binding/reference ContextPackage in _file_module_index@81; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _file_module_index(ctx: ContextPackage) -> dict[str, str]:
    """Returns ``file -> community name`` from `ctx.modules`, a reported annotation that nothing groups or splits files by."""
    file_community: dict[str, str] = {}
    for m in ctx.modules:
        for f in m.files:
            file_community.setdefault(f, m.name)
    return file_community

