source binding/reference str in _deadline_bounded@212; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _deadline_bounded(call, replay, *, cfg, tag: str, session_id: str) -> str:
    """*call*'s reply, or a resume of its own session once step4.deadline elapses; 0 = no clock."""
    seconds = _deadline_seconds(cfg)
    try:
        return run_with_deadline(call, seconds=seconds, stage=tag, effort=_REPLAY_EFFORT)
    except CallTimeoutError:
        console.write(f"  [s4] {tag}: deadline {seconds}s hit — resuming the session "
                      f"for its outcome")
        return resume_or_replay(session_id, replay, model=cfg.models.deepdiv

