source binding/reference int in ceiling_secs@41; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def ceiling_secs(s6) -> int:
    """Return `step6_verify.batch_wall_clock_ceiling` in seconds, <= 0 meaning disabled."""
    # One reader so pool and dispatch agree on <=0 -> off; NOT _cap_int, which maps -1 to 900s
    try:
        return max(0, int(getattr(s6, "batch_wall_clock_ceiling", 900)))
    except (TypeError, ValueError, OverflowError):
        return 900

