source binding/reference VerificationOutcomes in parse_outcomes@159; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def parse_outcomes(raw: str) -> VerificationOutcomes | None:
    """Parse a reply into outcomes, tolerating JSON-in-prose and a bare single outcome."""
    for attempt in (_validate_direct, _validate_salvaged, _validate_lone):
        parsed = attempt(raw)
        if parsed is not None:
            return parsed
    stripped = (raw or "").strip()
    COUNTERS.bump("s6_outcome_truncated" if stripped and not stripped.endswith("}")
                  else "s6_outcome_malformed")
    return None

source binding/reference str in parse_outcomes@159; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def parse_outcomes(raw: str) -> VerificationOutcomes | None:
    """Parse a reply into outcomes, tolerating JSON-in-prose and a bare single outcome."""
    for attempt in (_validate_direct, _validate_salvaged, _validate_lone):
        parsed = attempt(raw)
        if parsed is not None:
            return parsed
    stripped = (raw or "").strip()
    COUNTERS.bump("s6_outcome_truncated" if stripped and not stripped.endswith("}")
                  else "s6_outcome_malformed")
    return None

