source binding/reference Finding in title_overlap@47; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def title_overlap(a: Finding, b: Finding) -> float:
    """Jaccard overlap of two findings' title vocabularies; 1.0 when either title is empty."""
    ta, tb = _title_tokens(a.title), _title_tokens(b.title)
    if not ta or not tb:
        return 1.0
    return len(ta & tb) / len(ta | tb)

source binding/reference float in title_overlap@47; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def title_overlap(a: Finding, b: Finding) -> float:
