source binding/reference str in _reword_schema_terms@311; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _reword_schema_terms(text: str) -> str:
    """*text* with each schema-key phrase outside code spans in plain words."""
    if not text:
        return text
    parts = _CODE_SPAN_RX.split(text)
    for i in range(0, len(parts), 2):
        for rx, repl in _SUMMARY_WORDING:
            parts[i] = rx.sub(repl, parts[i])
    return "".join(parts)

