source binding/reference list in _mode_from@49; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _mode_from(args: list[str]) -> str:
    """Parse ``--mode fix|report-only`` (split or ``=`` form). Default: fix."""
    for i, a in enumerate(args):
        if a == "--mode" and i + 1 < len(args):
            return args[i + 1]
        if a.startswith("--mode="):
            return a.split("=", 1)[1]
    return "fix"

