source binding/reference str in _abbreviate@120; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _abbreviate(dotted: str) -> str:
    """Shorten ``vvaharness.backends.llm.tls`` to ``v.b.llm.tls`` the way enterprise log layouts do."""
    parts = dotted.split(".")
    if len(parts) < 3:
        return dotted
    return ".".join([p[0] for p in parts[:-2]] + parts[-2:])

