source binding/reference PricingTable in _provenance_cost@334; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _provenance_cost(model_id: str | None, bucket: TokenBucket,
                     pricing: PricingTable | None) -> float | None:
    """Cost a cached stage's OWN historical bucket against its OWN recorded model id."""
    if pricing is None:
        return None
    rate = pricing.models.get(model_id) if model_id else None
    if rate is not None:
