source binding/reference Path in _resolve_touched@118; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _resolve_touched(repo: Path, touched: str) -> Path | None:
    """Resolve a touched path under repo (``app/`` fallback); reject an escape (CWE-22)."""
    if Path(touched).is_absolute():
        return None
    for base in (repo / touched, repo / APP_DIRNAME / touched):
        candidate = _under_repo(repo, base)
        if candidate is not None and candidate.exists():
            return candidate
    return None

