source string key/name/status raw_score in OutputFinding@101._clamp_raw_score@142; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _clamp_raw_score(cls, v: object) -> object:
        """Clamp an out-of-range score instead of rejecting; raising drops it from the report."""
        if isinstance(v, bool) or not isinstance(v, (int, float)):
            return v
        score = float(v)
        clamped = min(1.0, max(0.0, score))
        if clamped != score:
            # Log only the normalized number: agent-controlled prose must never reach the log
            log.warning(
                "validation output raw_score=%r is outside [0.0, 1.0];

