source binding/reference Decision in _apply_verdicts@176; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def _apply_verdicts(config: ScoringConfig, raw_score: float) -> Decision:
    """Band a score onto a decision; a score under every threshold is INCONCLUSIVE."""
    for rule in config.verdicts:
        if raw_score >= rule.min_score:
            return rule.decision
    return Decision.INCONCLUSIVE

