source binding/reference FileChange in parse_diff_patch@121; its value/role follows this source operation, not a universal meaning shared with other scopes: def parse_diff_patch(workspace: Path) -> list[FileChange]:
    """Parse ``diff.patch`` into per-file changes (added line ranges + deletion flag); ``errors="replace"`` so a non-UTF-8 byte can't kill the session over line-oriented markup."""
    diff_file = workspace / DIFF_FILENAME
    if not diff_file.exists():
        return []
    parser = _DiffParser()
    for line in diff_file.read_text(errors="replace").splitlines():
        parser.feed(line)
    return parser.finish()

